<h2 id="draft-review">The draft review</h2>
<p>For the {{term:draft review}}, we sent the exact TSV we ship on Saturday at 12:30 and decided in advance what each returned number would mean. NSA returned minDCF {{num:0.0733|README.md#validation}} and EER {{num:3.534%|README.md#validation}}. The minDCF fell in our pre-declared {{num:0.00–0.20|README.md#validation}} band, so the rule stayed unchanged; the decoding table is on <a href="metric.html#decoding">the metric page</a>. {{src:README.md#validation|Source: the README.}}</p>
